 "remarks": "Incredible opportunity to rent a pristine unit in The Greenwich Lodge, a historic and impeccably maintained landmark in the center of Greenwich with an abundance of charm and ornate period details. Ideal location for residents within close proximity to Greenwich Ave, Restaurants, Transportation and Greenwich Hospital. Updated unit with generously sized rooms. An expansive living room/dining room with updated kitchenette boasting granite counter tops and newer appliances. A beautifully remodeled bathroom awaits you with gorgeous shower stall and glass enclosure. Capping off the unit is a spacious bedroom. The unit comes with bike storage, locker and gym access. Incredible water and city views from the rooftop sitting area. Book your showing today!",
